From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 09:25:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add exercise duplication and JSON session import
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ExercisesActivity: new "Duplicate" long-press action creates a new
  known exercise (same body part, no history) under a new name,
  avoiding the name-collision/retyping pain of Verifit's name-keyed
  exercise model (Exercise has no ID, only Name+BodyPart).
- DayActivity: new "Import Session" toolbar action reads a JSON file
  (docs/session-import-format.md) and additively merges its sets into
  the open day via DataStorage.mergeImportedSession(), without
  touching existing history — distinct from the existing CSV
  import/export path which is a full destructive backup restore.
  Meant as the integration point for an external workout-generator
  script: it writes this JSON, Verifit imports it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TSDf3AGUB7DYZ8pXgdseDy
